Import the exact local jbotci raw export and supplier metadata

Usage: candidate042-cli data-pack materialize jbotci [OPTIONS] <RAW> <METADATA> <OUTPUT>

Arguments:
  <RAW>       
  <METADATA>  
  <OUTPUT>    

Options:
      --revision <REVISION>
          [default: 3d9fd41d9ed32de26311ee27ec86b6b165985aa1]
      --raw-sha256 <RAW_SHA256>
          [default: 12e826751c3e50c10dd8df1adafb5f9eb32cdf542b22c4244f284b59d3824dde]
      --metadata-sha256 <METADATA_SHA256>
          [default: fe101eead51e0be1b885f3ee1b4555136e333e839baa250ddbd7b84c9af5fc98]
  -h, --help
          Print help
